Aim:
To develop an InsureEasy website to explore and compare insurance plans.

Algorithm:

Create the webpage structure using HTML.
Apply CSS to design the website layout.
Use JavaScript to display different insurance plans.
Allow users to search and compare insurance plans.
Display coverage details and premium amounts.
Provide a form to collect user details.
Allow users to select a suitable insurance plan.
Display the selected plan details based on user choice.

Result:
The InsureEasy website was developed successfully to view and compare insurance plans.
